{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世間有生，無不從父母而得。能誦此呪，及能慎終追遠，恩無不\n報。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爾雅云：東\n夷、西戎、南蠻、北狄，此四晦昧無知，謂之四海。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通、別經文，如前已引。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔子家語中丘吾子亦有此歎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周尸曰棺，謂櫬身也。周棺曰槨，謂櫬棺也。衣謂殮時之衣，衾謂\n單被。用此舉尸入棺，并覆尸上也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簠簋者，祭器名也。受\n一斗二升，足高一寸，如龜形也。簠內方外圓，簋內圓外方，俱丹中漆外，器素無飾，表有哀慼之心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "男踊謂以足跳踊也，女擗謂露胷擗擊也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宅，墓穴也。兆，塋域也。葬事大，故卜選安置也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗，尊也。廟，貌也。立其尊貌，以鬼禮享之，似見父母也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "影於冬夏也。寒暑變移，轉加增感，四時祭祀，展其孝思。上注皆䟽，廣如彼文中具。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取歲星行一次也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取四時祭祀一終也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取禾一熟義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐堯、虞舜取物終更始義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云淨飯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上是諸佛也。斷一切種冥，謂不染汙\n無知，證非擇滅。若斷諸冥，謂染汙無知，證於擇滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前句自利，\n此句利他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "施，音異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音試"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音試"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分九州地，建諸侯國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂王畿內及諸侯國中，置公卿之都，立大夫士之邑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "親四，始祖一，文武二，祧合為七也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此在七外也。封土曰壇，除地曰\n墠。近親封土，遠親除地，示將去然也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "父廟曰考。考，成也，謂父有成德之美也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖廟也。王，君也，言祖有君成之德也。祖尊於父，故加君名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾祖也。皇，大也，\n君也。曾祖轉尊，故加大君之稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高祖也。顯明高祖，居四廟最上也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖，始也。此廟為王家之始，故曰祖考"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二祧，文武廟也。文武並在應遷之例，故云遠也。特為功德而留，故謂之祧。祧之言超，言其超然上去也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "享嘗，四時祭也。文武特留，故不月祭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂高祖之父也。昭行\n\n寄藏武祧，穆行寄藏文祧，四時不祭。若有祈禱，則出就壇受祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂高祖之祖也，\n不得在壇。若有祈禱，則出就墠受祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若又有從壇遷來墠者，則此前在墠者，遷入石函為鬼，不祈禱也。唯禘祫乃出之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "適士，\n上士也。官師，中士、下士也。庶士，府史之屬也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉孝悌以為教，則天下之為人子弟者，無不敬其父兄也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉臣道以為教，則天下之\n為人臣者，無不敬其君也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教民親愛父母，禮順\n兄長，莫加於孝悌也。悌，友也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "風俗移易，先入樂聲。變隨\n人心，正由君德。正之興變，因樂而彰。樂聲哀怨，知國亡亂。樂聲和美，知國善政。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮所以正君臣父子之別，明男女長幼之殊，故可以安上化下也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬者，禮之本也。禮以恭儉莊敬為主也。有禮無敬，禮不可行，故以敬為本也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝悌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟，孝經作悌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依孝設教，法天常明，法地常利，以順\n天下人心，故得教令。不待誠肅，自然而成。不行嚴厲，自然而治。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "博，廣也。君愛其\n\n親，以此化民。民化君德，無有遺棄其親者也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳說\n德義之美，為眾所慕，則民起思而行之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齋莊中正\n為敬，推功尚善為讓。以化化民，民不爭競也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮以\n檢其跡，樂以正其心，則和睦矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "示好以引之，示惡以\n止之，則民知禁令，不敢犯也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子思是伯魚之子，孔子之孫也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起踵曰企，俛首曰俯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "親喪三日，不食不漿。\n太近則抑於賢達，太遠則遺於不肖。齊此三日，可謂得中。三年之喪亦然，蓋令賢愚俯企也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姓宰，名予，字子我，孔\n\n子弟子也。期，周年也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熟也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "馬曰：春取榆柳火，夏取棗杏火，秋取柞楢火，冬取槐檀火。一年之中，鑽火異木，故曰改火"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不達子意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "美也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知己之非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：始自天子，下達庶人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：言子之於父母，欲報之恩，昊天罔極，而宰予也有三年之\n愛父母乎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "豈無聖人之德，\n加過勝於孝乎？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性，生也。天生萬物，人最靈貴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "百行之源。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴，尊敬也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天生萬物，父生於子。尊敬其父莫大，故配於天。\n而同祭之，始自周公。以父配天，故曰其人也。周公，姓姬，名旦。當周成王時，為太師。以是三公之首，故曰周\n公。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "后稷，乃周之始祖也。郊者，郊壇，亦名\n圜丘，祀天之處也。周公攝政，因行郊天之祭，乃尊始祖后稷，故以侑坐配食於昊天上帝於圜丘之上也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明堂者，布政之宮也。在城南七里之內，居\n陽明之地，故曰明堂。周公尊祀其父文王，以侑坐配食於五方上帝於明堂之上也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君行嚴配之禮，見德教垂於四海。海內諸侯，各修職\n貢，來助祭也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此結答曾子也。聖人\n亦依孝而治也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦同孔聖云至德要道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "父母全而生之，子當全而歸之，故不敢毀傷也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立其身德，行其孝道，播揚其美\n\n於後世，光顯其親也。故行孝以不毀為先，揚名於後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去弭切，半步也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄭曰：\n受身體於父母，不敢毀傷，故使弟子開衾視之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：喻己常戒慎，恐有毀傷也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周曰：而乃今日而後，我自知免於患難矣。小子者，呼諸弟子，欲使聽誌其言，知而行之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "棺等如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此夏、殷時祭名也。至周時則改春曰祠，夏曰礿，秋曰嘗，冬曰蒸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夏者，尊𢍉禮著；秋者，萬物成熟，各稱盛也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、歲終；二、夏滿；三、忌辰。隨力所及，皆須為父母放生，命一七乃\n至七七之數。初七、諸七、卒哭、祥日亦然，異今時俗，但滿三年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如愛禮存羊之類也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三王，\n夏、殷、周也。夏禹為舜司空，有賢德，能治水，置九州，分地界，鑿龍門山。舜見有功，禪位與之，天下歸化，父子\n十九世也。殷者，始為商代，後改為殷。殷時湯王是夏桀之臣，見君無道，遂伐之，德化天下，父子三十世也。\n周文王始為西伯，在岐州，紂民八十餘萬戶皆投西伯，伯給與衣食。子武王紹位，伐無道紂，德化天下，父\n子三十七世也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五帝：少昊、顓頊、高辛、唐堯、虞舜也。設教化民，教名五典。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三皇：伏羲、神農、黃帝也。設教化民，名三墳也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄭曰：牲生曰餼。禮：人君每月告朔於廟，有祭謂之朝享。魯自文公始不視朔，子貢見其禮廢，欲去其羊也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "包曰：羊存猶以識其禮，羊亡禮遂廢\n也。愛，惜也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "易有此文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "月令云：九月中氣，日在氐，命有司合秩蒭以養犧牲，乃至祭宗廟之靈，為\n人祈福也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故途中有歌哭二類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霜降後，日在氐宿也。於日昏時，女宿正中，斗建戌位也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九月，合收木秩。蒭，草也。犧牲，謂純色\n牛、羊、豕也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古聖政治至極者，美德馨香，感動於神明，非黍稷之馨，乃是明德之\n馨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爾應崇尚式敬周公之遺訓也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周公沒後，姪成王重於周公所營，故命君陳分政東郊，彼處為治。成王誠\n言，惟日孜孜，依政治之，不得逸豫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須闍太子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於儒禮雖不同，而亦哀有餘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尚書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：高宗，殷之中興王，名武丁也。諒，信也。陰，默也。默然三年矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：冢宰，謂天官卿，佐王治者也。三年喪畢，然後王自聽政。彼疏曰：百官有事，\n不咨於君，各總己事，皆自束身，束己職事。聽於冢宰，上卿也。聽，從也。冢，太也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泣而無聲，\n如出血也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不言笑也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴雖有異，祭意大同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如觀經說，當修三福：一、孝養父母，乃至此三種業，是三世諸佛淨土正因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "制比丘等年年自恣之日行此法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸得道人未必皆為父母，即驗目連為欲報恩故出家也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "醜，眾也。爭，競也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牛、羊、豕為三牲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爭，去聲呼，是極諫之名。父母有過，子當極諫之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱，謂不稱揚其過也。無犯，不犯顏而諫之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左右，謂扶持之。方，常也。子\n於親無如常人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勤，謂勞辱之事也。致，謂慼容稱其服\n也。此以恩為制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既諫之，有人問其國政者，可語得失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可侵官"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方喪，資於事父。凡此以義\n為制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心喪，慼容如父而無服也。此以恩義之間為制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "承順父母顏色，乃為難也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "許慎切，罪也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上如字，又音寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音希，生純色，牛完全。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徐閏切，求也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音頻煩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去聲，供也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音余，共舉也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "式亮\n切，饋也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音出貶下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音挺，小船。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音白，大船。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上旬宣切，速疾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙減切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古典切，蠶衣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "母本切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音隆，天勢高升也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音滂薄，地勢混同也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音袁，引也。漢儒解孝經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音𦂛，布設也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音倣，至也；下諸，之\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音短，截也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音杵，安止也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音利，臨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下去聲，供\n也。下敬養、侍養倣此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七性切，寒也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音出剔，恐而肅敬之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音檜，雞越\n郡名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音甫軌，祭器。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音基，語助也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音欽，大被也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音挑，遷廟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音善除地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音的上士也，即今之正卿。中士，今之朝官。下士，今之京官也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下去\n聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音急，子思名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音腫，足跟也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音昨，由柔木也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音員，天體也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音右，對坐也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音所，計也。計其月不出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音抽，疾瘥也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音\n除，具也，即豐備矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音矣，哭餘聲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音崔，喪服。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徒結切，麻帶也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音資崔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去聲呼，舒緩也，去祭遠故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音藥弟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伊金切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "列者，人姓也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音善，讓位也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下上聲，除也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音谷，告上也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音戲，牲生也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音潮，早也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音姪初。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音貫，漢時於宮前造東\n西兩觀，今之史館也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初思切，奪也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音貫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "烏丸切，削取也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音\n奪道紀敬脫二皆高僧，亦擔母侍養傳法者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下平聲，然也，不言國政。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼弘切，君\n亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音現，露也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音體，泣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上巨寒切，下音弟。此集眾作相\n之具，鐘鼓總名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "訛略。梵語若具，應云窣覩波，此云高顯處。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音義費。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音闢，法也。謂節制其罪，即大罪也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音月，絕也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音略，奪取。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去\n聲，止也。下爭父同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各有司職，不可相侵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方類也。資於事父者，資，取也，謂君崩\n\n比取事父矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下平聲，謂非經史所載。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音沌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音敖，犬高四尺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上已釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘四者，涌泉出生，繩墨顯示也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂觀身不淨，觀受是\n苦，觀心無常，觀法無我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "標舍衛等十地菩薩，謂是淨土；聲聞等眾，謂是穢土。一處見異，淨穢雙彰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一時之言，具含長短。利根謂短，悟解速故；鈍根謂長，悟解遲故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遊歷之境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國是總名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "園是別故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤者，少而無父也；獨者，老而無子也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乳哺如濟食，是恩之實事；度脫\n如扶輪，是報之實事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十三，周幽王好征伐，人民勞\n苦，孝子不得終養耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音覆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "反如\n齧指心痛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "笥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔曰：顏淵樂道，\n雖簞食在陋󳮯，不改其所樂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一云在此贍部四邊直下等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無財，不見飲食故；炬\n口，食未入口，化為火故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太建二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：西域此時安居，漢地安居已經一月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：西域此時自恣，漢地已經一月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作白成不？答云：成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨成不？答云：成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：單白和僧自恣羯磨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作白成不？\n答云：成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧皆依唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福是定也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "房舍、衣服、飯食、湯藥\n為四事，食之米麵、味之鹽醋、果之李柰、󳳲之芥薑為八珍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經行自利，教化利他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各有其文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聲聞、緣覺為實為小，十地、菩薩為權為大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云男女不取兄弟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為眾請法救度父母，非是請問受持遺法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非是付囑受持遺法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寐寤而莊\n公已生，故驚而惡之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲立以為太子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "京城，今滎陽京縣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "完城郭，聚人民"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "步曰卒，車\n\n曰乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "掩不備曰襲。啟，開也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音恭，國名也。共國，今汲郡共縣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寘，置\n也。城潁，鄭地也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "封人，典封彊者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "融融，和樂貌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音曳，舒散貌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "純，猶\n篤也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本作利字，悞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巨隕切。迫也。又音郡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本六慈恩有解，今\n勘浙本及川本古疏，皆無慈恩字。況慈恩法門宗匠，必時人不敢容易指斥，故從而削去。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音閭，九寺名也。鴻，大也。臚，陳序也。言大陳序所須，以禮待外國之賓也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音綠，叔豆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音撫，拍也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音丹，竹器也。下毗消切，蠡也，即匏片持水耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本作挊，義同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音儒，短衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音早瑟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音魘，塞也。課，責也。當二親齋忌，無至誠脩福，但厭\n塞人之課責，故為之耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上，初委切，私取也。又準藏中本經音義，亦團呼之，攬取也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "料量也。豈料者，不能測量也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音基，語助，出禮記注文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音高。俞，肥也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音兮，名甘口鼠，好食牛角。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音鶻，本下革切，語忌也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦外切。準四分律行事鈔云：糩\n果柔脩淨。音義指歸云：糩，麤糠也。果子殼如糠。注云：松柏之子也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音稔。說文：桂，荏蘇\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音陵，芰也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音定，燈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音了，火也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "深大也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音晦，財也。此\n喻時人所忌，然疏文盛行，未敢輒改。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上，庾頃切。說文：水出潁川陽城也。鈔：申引春秋\n云：潁考叔為潁谷封人。注云：典封疆者。春秋疏正義曰：周禮：封人掌為畿封而樹之。鄭玄云：畿上有封，若\n今時界也。言潁谷封人，皆以地名封人。蓋封人職典封疆，居在邊邑。潁谷是國之邊邑也，如今之守邊城\n寨主。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "許六切，勉也，勸也，即勸勉信念二力。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結前目連問教。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結前設供獲益。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音再，則也，即是語助，與且字同，不須云荷載。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音辢，梵語彈舌呼也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音漾，隋朝帝號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音青，廁也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音俄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二皆去聲，呼之應聲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "厭。去聲。疏音義中音魘，別作一義解，詳義取捨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敕六切，積也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本疏中作廂，傳悞\n鈔文，隨而解釋。今依古疏勘定，改正作箱，故引毛詩并注證之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繫音係，聯也。舊本鈔\n引千字文注解：二人同心且非經史，況彼人姓管名寧字幼安，又將一人名字分作兩人說之，難為依據。\n\n故今從周易繫辭并注文改正耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此段鈔文，數處差悞，極害義理，已依律中改正。其餘\n義稍可通，故存舊說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下奴當切。有底曰囊，無底曰槖。此所引涅槃經，有五重乞喻，五篇罪\n犯。今次第引之，配合可解。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下音雉，舊作理字者，以唐高宗諱治，故作理呼，今依尚書正文\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音器，數也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音洹，兮也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音捨，置也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去\n聲，呼贈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X57n0968_p0336a17"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X21n0375_p0533c13"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T54n2128_p0420a03"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X21n0375_p0533c13"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T54n2128_p0420a03"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《佛光大辭典》：梵語 rāksasa。惡鬼之名。又作羅剎娑（羅剎婆為誤寫）。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T22n1428_p0766a22"}
{"id": null, "n": "0519a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0519a0101", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
